{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:26 2026-10-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:26 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:26 2026-10-24 HKT</p><img alt=\"瓦努阿圖爆6.9級強震，當局發海嘯預警暫未獲傷亡損毀報告。USGS\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb6a10e2b9cf4249e4725cdfaf8ec70b/2026-10/KF_-Sam_81_.png\"/><p>據美國地質調查局（USGS）消息，瓦努阿圖索拉（Sola）以西約200公里（124英里）處海域於周六（24日）發生6.9級地震，震源深度為10公里（6.2英里）。</p><p>太平洋海嘯預警中心發布海嘯預警。目前未有傷亡或損毀報告。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:44:10.425051+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:26:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:30.259811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:38:15.709856+00:00","content_hash":"edbf16c1c6e321c0862daa750ae91eadb7e5213844d8dbd396ba41ec6e4f7965","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}